    "rich_text_custom_YyFr9y": {
      "type": "rich-text--custom",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_fNnDyw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How our clinicians are regulated",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_9JVri8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every Settle clinician is a UK-registered Consultant Psychiatrist regulated by the General Medical Council (GMC). The GMC is the independent regulator for doctors practising in the United Kingdom - every Settle psychiatrist holds full GMC registration with a specialist licence to practise in psychiatry, and is on the Specialist Register for General Adult Psychiatry.<br/><br/>Settle's clinical services are delivered by Curate Health Limited, the regulated clinical entity behind Settle, which holds independent registration with the Care Quality Commission. Medication is dispensed by Curate Pharmacy, our in-house pharmacy, registered with the General Pharmaceutical Council.<br/>You can verify any Settle clinician's registration on the GMC's online register at gmc-uk.org.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
