    "image_with_list_reverse_text_8CNGkE": {
      "type": "image-with-list-reverse-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_VXB3xg": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A message from our Medical Director",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_GAM7Qq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When I first started working in adult ADHD, the patients I saw were almost always exhausted before they got to me. Years of NHS waitlists, GP rejections, private services that prescribed and disappeared, and the slow erosion of believing themselves about their own brain.<br/>Settle was built to be different. Every patient sees a consultant psychiatrist — not a pharmacist, not an algorithm, not a different person every six months. The clinician who diagnoses you is the clinician who titrates you, reviews you, and prescribes for you year after year. We're a small team by design. We'd rather see fewer patients well than more patients badly.<br/>If you've been waiting, masking, or wondering — we built this for you.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "signature_text_nJAW9j": {
          "type": "signature_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group.png",
            "heading": "Dr Doniert Mcfarlane",
            "text": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
